# Large image assets must be hosted on R2 / Cloudflare Pages, NOT in git.
# 89 PNGs at 2–3 MB each = 165 MB of repo bloat. See docs/CI_SECRETS.md for
# the 2026-06 audit that flagged this. Whitelist a handful of small logos
# / favicons that the layout statically references.
public/img/
!public/img/logo.png
!public/img/fav.png
!public/img/logoo.png
!public/img/onlylogo.png
!public/img/dnscreen.png

